{"kp_id": "zj-054.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-054", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "丑时（半夜1–3点）气血入肝经；肝属木色青，开窍于目、主筋。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.lr", "zangfu.gan"], "chapter_id": "zj-054.c01", "evidence_quote": "半夜一点到三点就进入肝经", "seg_from": 14, "seg_to": 45, "start_s": 95.87, "end_s": 290.73, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z0K4mScuDaA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0K4mScuDaA&t=95s", "series": "zj", "episode": 54, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Constitution\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90-Episode Series: Acupuncture 54", "start_s": 95.87, "end_s": 290.73}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-054.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-054", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "嘘字功：手轻覆肝区，吸气后口发「嘘」排肝浊；勿过度致肝气过旺。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.gan"], "chapter_id": "zj-054.c01", "evidence_quote": "嘴巴发嘘", "seg_from": 106, "seg_to": 107, "start_s": 577.36, "end_s": 597.7, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z0K4mScuDaA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0K4mScuDaA&t=577s", "series": "zj", "episode": 54, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Constitution\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90-Episode Series: Acupuncture 54", "start_s": 577.36, "end_s": 597.7}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-054.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-054", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "肝病常丑时醒；治后醒来时刻后移以至通宵可睡，为好转之征。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.gan"], "chapter_id": "zj-054.c01", "evidence_quote": "他本来是一点半才能睡觉", "seg_from": 137, "seg_to": 139, "start_s": 749.39, "end_s": 771.825, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z0K4mScuDaA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0K4mScuDaA&t=749s", "series": "zj", "episode": 54, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Constitution\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90-Episode Series: Acupuncture 54", "start_s": 749.39, "end_s": 771.83}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-054.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-054", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "大敦为肝经井穴属木，即本穴，虚实皆可用；拇趾外侧取之，内侧为隐白。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr1", "acupoint.sp1"], "chapter_id": "zj-054.c02", "evidence_quote": "叫大墩靠", "seg_from": 190, "seg_to": 265, "start_s": 1063.55, "end_s": 1493.814, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z0K4mScuDaA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0K4mScuDaA&t=1063s", "series": "zj", "episode": 54, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Constitution\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90-Episode Series: Acupuncture 54", "start_s": 1063.55, "end_s": 1493.81}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "大墩/大灯=大敦", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-054.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-054", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "行间在一二跖骨交接后方，荥火穴；急性肝炎、黄疸等实热可取。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.lr2"], "chapter_id": "zj-054.c03", "evidence_quote": "行间都可以治疗", "seg_from": 272, "seg_to": 290, "start_s": 1519.119, "end_s": 1636.374, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z0K4mScuDaA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0K4mScuDaA&t=1519s", "series": "zj", "episode": 54, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Constitution\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90-Episode Series: Acupuncture 54", "start_s": 1519.12, "end_s": 1636.37}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-054.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-054", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "开四关：左右合谷配太冲；合谷主气、太冲主血，同针气血兼顾。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.li4", "acupoint.lr3"], "chapter_id": "zj-054.c04", "evidence_quote": "我们叫做开四关", "seg_from": 309, "seg_to": 314, "start_s": 1717.509, "end_s": 1755.979, "citation": {"youtube_id": "z0K4mScuDaA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z0K4mScuDaA&t=1717s", "series": "zj", "episode": 54, "title": "Ni Hai-hsia \"Human Constitution\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90-Episode Series: Acupuncture 54", "start_s": 1717.51, "end_s": 1755.98}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
